and he was created in 1928 (copies of the first of the serious are worth
about $2,000, or were last time I checked).  Batman came soon afterwards.
Superman was the one whose mission was "truth, justice, and the American
way."  It's interesting to think about how his character was raised by
farmers from rural America, and then went to the city well-schooled in
traditional American values to defend them.

